<title>FRANCE: GEC candidate for Thomson-CSF - Le Monde.</title>
<headline>GEC candidate for Thomson-CSF - Le Monde.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's GEC Plc has declared itself candidate for the acquisition of the state's 58-percent stake in defence electronics group Thomson-CSF, the Le Monde newspaper said.</p>
<p>&quot;The French government has difficulty hiding its embarrassment -- the British group General Electric Company (GEC) is candidate for the privatisation of the defence and professional electronics group Thomson-CSF,&quot; Le Monde said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Newspapers Le Figaro and La Tribune Desfosses published similar reports this morning.</p>
